    "result_text": "All 268 tests pass with BUILD SUCCESS.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented the owner initials feature. Since the mapper (`toOwnerDto`) is used by both the create (`RespondWithOwnerCreated`) and read (`RespondWithOwner`) responders, adding the derived field there makes it appear consistently in the owner response.\n\n**Changes:**\n1. `src/main/resources/openapi.yml` \u2014 added a read-only `initials` string property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` has the field.\n2. `src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java` \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` computing `initials` as `Character.toUpperCase(firstName[0]) + \".\" + Character.toUpperCase(lastName[0]) + \".\"` \u2014 the upper-cased first letters of first and last name, dot-separated with a trailing dot (e.g. `J.S.`), mirroring the existing `displayName` expression pattern.\n\nThe new `Cp07Tests.coreInitials` passes and the full suite (268 tests) is green.",
